        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 114,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_14",
      "hash64": "141F013C5754C717",
      "text": "Deshalb dachte ich... Ähm...\\nWehe, du lachst jetzt![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 51,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_15",
      "hash64": "141F003C5754C564",
      "text": "Ich hab mich dazu entschieden... Koch zu werden.[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 48,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_16",
      "hash64": "141F033C5754CA7D",
      "text": "Was ich auf den Teller zaubere, wird so nahrhaft\\nsein, dass jedes noch so schwächelnde Pokémon\\r\\nwieder auf die Beine kommt![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 125,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_03",
      "hash64": "2DAEA169789496FA",
      "text": "Eine phänomenale Idee!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_select_04",
      "hash64": "2DAE9C6978948E7B",
      "text": "Wenn das jemand kann, dann du!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_17",
      "hash64": "141F023C5754C8CA",
      "text": "Hehe, ich dachte mir schon, dass du so was\\nsagen würdest. Auf dich ist Verlass![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "kizuna_friend_d_18a",
      "hash64": "854D878864EBDAD6",
      "text": "Ich will in der kulinarischen Welt irgendwann mal\\nso eine krasse Nummer sein, wie es meine Mutter\\r\\nals Forscherin war, verstehst du?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
